// ---- the rows' layouts (vec4s)
// a cloud's row (CR_W), the processor's: bx, deck, s, puffK | its lobes' run: first row, rows, its extras' first row (-1 none), its shape's
// number | thr, flags (1 wisp, 2 the hero, 4 its recipe is its own), storm, wz | its morph's start, length, its reach (extU), uid | its
