// THE GATHER (Nov 10, engine part 6 - once the processor's gatherSmokeNew / smnPuff / smnLumpy / smnAdd / smBox): the balls made from
// the items (THE ITEMS above) in compute, each from hashes alone, appended in no fixed order -
//   gclear  (args) the counts and the box emptied
//   gseed   a workgroup an item: its seeds (a call of smnPuff each) appended - a puff: thread 0 its own, 1..24 the chain's fillers (a
//           lumpy one and, now and then, a smaller one tucked beside it), 25..48 the mouth's; a trail piece: a thread a blob (a blob
//           under 2.2 cells is one ball - a 'single' seed), threads 0..6 its root's puffs; a rocket puff: thread 0
//   gargs0  (args) gball's dispatch from the seeds' count
//   gball   a workgroup a seed: its balls, each (puff, bump, small ball) a thread computing it alone - s = c / 24 the puff (0 its own or a
//           heap's deep one, 1..6 a heap's billows), k = c % 24 / 3 (0 its main ball, 1..7 a bump), m = c % 3 (1, 2 a bump's small
//           balls); kept if it shows (a > 0.02) and touches the picture; appended with its key (BK), its claim on its slot (crit, from
//           its key - order-free), its box (whole cells, atomic min / max)
//   gargs   (args) the paint's state (ST) and every later dispatch's and the splat's draw's counts (IA: indirect) from the balls'
